cte de celle des routes statiques.","sidebar":"docs"},"security/supabase-rls":{"id":"security/supabase-rls","title":"Supabase RLS","description":"Principe","sidebar":"docs"},"system/overview":{"id":"system/overview","title":"Vue système et domaines fonctionnels","description":"Vue d'ensemble","sidebar":"docs"},"system/project-structure":{"id":"system/project-structure","title":"Carte du repository","description":"Vue d'ensemble","sidebar":"docs"},"system/recovery-checklist":{"id":"system/recovery-checklist","title":"Checklist de reprise technique","description":"Reprise projet","sidebar":"docs"},"testing/diagnostic-tools":{"id":"testing/diagnostic-tools","title":"Outils de diagnostic","description":"Outils et méthodes pour diagnostiquer rapidement les problèmes Firebase, Supabase et documentation.","sidebar":"docs"},"testing/firebase-test":{"id":"testing/firebase-test","title":"Test Firebase","description":"Vérifier la configuration et la connectivité Firebase (Auth, RTDB, Storage)."},"testing/overview":{"id":"testing/overview","title":"Tests et assurance qualité","description":"État réel de la suite de tests (mesuré le 2026-07-17)","sidebar":"docs"},"testing/scripts":{"id":"testing/scripts","title":"Scripts","description":"Scripts utiles","sidebar":"docs"},"testing/supabase-test":{"id":"testing/supabase-test","title":"Test Supabase","description":"Vérifier la configuration et la connectivité Supabase."},"testing/unit-tests":{"id":"testing/unit-tests","title":"Tests unitaires (Vue + Vitest)","description":"Installation"},"troubleshooting/env-encoding":{"id":"troubleshooting/env-encoding","title":"Encodage .env","description":"Corriger les problèmes d’encodage du fichier .env (variables non lues, caractères espacés, erreurs Vite/Firebase)."},"troubleshooting/firebase-auth":{"id":"troubleshooting/firebase-auth","title":"Erreur Firebase Auth","description":"Résoudre l’erreur:"},"troubleshooting/firebase-env":{"id":"troubleshooting/firebase-env","title":"Problèmes Varia